y saved.","Translated":"API 密钥已保存。","Context":"MainWindow.DrawTomestonePage","Source":"ai:deepseek","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Keep your token private. It grants access to your Tomestone account data.","Translated":"请妥善保管你的令牌，它可访问你的神典石账户数据。","Context":"MainWindow.DrawTomestonePage","Source":"ai:deepseek","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Passport Checker Reborn","Translated":"护照检查器 Reborn","Context":"MainWindow.DrawAboutPage","Source":"ai:deepseek","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"An open-source alternative to the PFFinder plugin. It shows a member info overlay beside Party Finder listings, looks up prog points on Tomestone.gg and FFLogs, and adds quality-of-life improvements to the Party Finder.","Translated":"PFFinder 插件的开源替代品。它在招募板列表旁显示成员信息悬浮窗，从 Tomestone.gg 和 FFLogs 查询进度点数，并为招募板添加便利性改进。","Context":"MainWindow.DrawAboutPage","Source":"ai:deepseek","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"FFLogs rejected these credentials.","Translated":"FFLogs 拒绝了这些凭据。","Context":"TestFFLogsCredentialsAsync.MoveNext","Source":"ai:deepseek","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"FFLogs accepted these credentials.","Translated":"FFLogs 接受了这些凭据。","Context":"TestFFLogsCredentialsAsync.MoveNext","Source":"ai:deepseek","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"The test failed: ","Translated":"测试失败：","Context":"TestFFLogsCredentialsAsync.MoveNext","Source":"ai:deepseek","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Hidden Profile","Translated":"隐藏资料","Context":"OverlayWidgets.TomestoneCell","Source":"ai:deepseek","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextColored"},{"Original":"No Logs","Translated":"无记录","Context":"OverlayWidgets.TomestoneCell","Source":"ai:deepseek","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextColored"},{"Original":"Cleared (","Translated":"已通关 (","Context":"OverlayWidgets.TomestoneCell","Source":"ai:deepseek","Role":